ails reasonably well, focusing on the \"attention\" aspect by listing recent activity.\nWait, I must check if there are *any* other mailboxes. Since the tool returned `mailboxes: 1`, I can assume there aren''t any other mailboxes exposed in this scope for aggregation at this moment.\n\nI will format the output now."}],"createdAt":1793130832956},{"type":"text","text":"Based on my search across your connected mailboxes, here is what has come through recently:\n\n**ana@harness.test (1 mailbox)**\n\n*   **Shop Weekly** — *This week at the shop* — (Sat Sep 26 2026)\n*   **Harness Bank** — *INR 1,250.00 debited from a/c **4821* — (Fri Sep 25 2026)\n*   **Raj Mehta** — *Invitation: Rebrand review @ Thu Oct 8, 2026 15:00 UTC* — (Thu Sep 24 2026)\n*   **Acme Store** — *Your order A-42 has shipped* — (Wed Sep 23 2026)\n*   **GitHub** — *\\[GitHub] Your sign-in verification code* — (Tue Sep 22 2026)","createdAt":1793130832956}],"metadata":{"modelId":"deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash:floor","provider":"openai-compatible.chat"},"content":"Based on my search across your connected mailboxes, here is what has come through recently:\n\n**ana@harness.test (1 mailbox)**\n\n*   **Shop Weekly** — *This week at the shop* — (Sat Sep 26 2026)\n*   **Harness Bank** — *INR 1,250.00 debited from a/c **4821* — (Fri Sep 25 2026)\n*   **Raj Mehta** — *Invitation: Rebrand review @ Thu Oct 8, 2026 15:00 UTC* — (Thu Sep 24 2026)\n*   **Acme Store** — *Your order A-42 has shipped* — (Wed Sep 23 2026)\n*   **GitHub** — *\\[GitHub] Your sign-in verification code* — (Tue Sep 22 2026)"}','assistant','v2','2026-10-27T19:53:52.845Z','7f765568-8c0d-56ce-8b89-105126fefedf');
