ion. This kind of information is usually found in emails (notifications, receipts, order tracking updates) or perhaps in a \"Dashboard\" or \"Orders\" section within a drive, but since the user didn''t specify a tool, I will start with email search as that is the most likely place for shipping updates.\n\nPlan:\n1. Search emails (all mailboxes) for keywords like \"shipped\", \"order\", \"shipping\", \"tracking\", \"delivery\".\n2. If email search is unsuccessful, I will search files in the drives for \"order\" or \"shipping\" documents.\n\nInitial tool call will be `searchMail`.The user is asking about recent shipments of orders.\nI need to check `search_tools` to find tools related to orders, shipping, or tracking.\nThen I will check if there are any available tools to query orders/shipments.\nAfter checking tools, I'' capabilities, I will proceed with the required search/data retrieval.\nSince this is a new domain (orders/shipments), I must use `search_tools` first.The user asks about order shipments. This is about emails — order confirmations/shipping notifications across mailboxes. Let me search mail for shipping/order keywords across all mailboxes.\n\nI should search mail for \"shipped\", \"order\", \"tracking\", \"delivery\". Let me do a couple of searches in parallel."}],"createdAt":1793130843678},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"count":0,"emails":[]},"toolCallId":"chatcmpl-tool-9c3712691643fdbe","toolName":"searchMail","args":{"query":"shipped order tracking","mailboxId":null}},"updatedAt":1793130845481},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"count":0,"emails":[]},"toolCallId":"chatcmpl-tool-826543fc4a3f19d3","toolName":"searchMail","args":{"query":"order shipped","mailboxId":null}},"updatedAt":1793130845481},{"type":"step-start","createdAt":1793130845483,"model":"openai-compatible.chat/deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash:floor"},{"type":"reasoning","reasoning":"The initial search for \"shipped